ict runs far deeper than simple terrorism. Behind the chaos, shadowy organizations vie for dominance, and the conspiracy surrounding the Gray Death's origins forces Denton to question everything he knows about his employers, his mission, and the future of civilization itself.", "summary": "A philosophical first-person WRPG set in a dystopian 2052 in which JC Denton, a nano-augmented agent for the anti-terrorist organization UNATCO, is tasked with stopping the invasion of Liberty Island by the terrorist group NSF. As events unfold, Denton finds that he plays a large part in a world-spanning conspiracy which forces him to ponder his allegiances, beliefs, morality, and view of right and wrong.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/deus-ex", "videos": [{"id": 29651, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "pL4-QSMH0ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pL4-QSMH0ho", "title": "Deus Ex (2000) PC", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pL4-QSMH0ho/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 70115, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "zStn70Ot4r0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zStn70Ot4r0", "title": "Deus Ex - Intro HD", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zStn70Ot4r0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 131499, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "e7dR_vRwNbE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e7dR_vRwNbE", "title": "Deus Ex (2000) - Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/e7dR_vRwNbE/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 9, "name": "Deus Ex"}], "characters": [{"id": 2566, "name": "Mechanic Special"}, {"id": 2560, "name": "Power Guy"}, {"id": 2563, "name": "Cathedral Chef"}, {"id": 2629, "mug_shot": {"id": 94, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sk6plpvidj43a3ucxeur.jpg"}, "name": "Walton Simons"}, {"id": 2639, "name": "Veteran"}, {"id": 2640, "name": "Terrorists B"}, {"id": 2577, "nam